<title>USA: Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>For periods ended Nov 30</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.96		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			127,000		   69,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,068,000		  884,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 116,900		  117,100</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.24		    $1.76</p>
<p> Net			416,000		  242,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,444,000		3,071,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 116,400		  113,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Qtr net includes charges of $84 million vs $97 million.</p>
<p>Net available to comon was $113 million vs $58 million in quarter and $378 million vs $200 million in year.</p>
<p>Revenues were net revenues after interest expenses of $2.74 bln vs $2.73 bln in quarter and $10.82 bln vs $10.40 bln in year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
